### Get semua inventaris
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inventaris

### Get detail barang
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inventaris/4

### Post Tambah Barang baru
POST http://localhost:3000/api/inventaris
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nama": "Laptop Legion 5 Pro - Ruang Dosen",
    "kategori": "Komputer",
    "jumlah": 1,
    "kondisi": "Baik"
}

### Error 404 (ID tidak ada)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/inventaris/99

### Error 400 (Data tidak lengkap)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/inventaris
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "jumlah": 5
}

### Error 400 (Format Bukan JSON)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/inventaris